<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title>Help- CricPulse Stream</title>
    <!-- <link
      rel="icon"
      href="https://thumbs.dreamstime.com/b/cricket-sport-comet-fire-tail-flying-throw-logo-isolated-symbol-icon-badge-89929962.jpg"
      type="image/x-icon"
    /> -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/favicon2.png" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  </head>

  <body
    class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900 via-black to-red-900 min-h-screen flex flex-col"
  >
    <nav class="bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-white/10">
      <div
        class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center text-white"
      >
        <a href="/" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-red-500">
          Cric<span class="text-white">Pulse</span>
        </a>

        <div class="space-x-4 font-bold text-sm md:text-base">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-red-400 transition">Home</a>
          <a href="/live-matches" class="hover:text-red-400 transition">Watch</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="hover:text-red-400 transition">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <div
      class="flex-grow flex items-center justify-center px-4 md:px-6 py-8 md:py-12"
    >
      <div class="max-w-4xl w-full space-y-5 md:space-y-6">
        <h2
          class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-center text-white mb-6 md:mb-8"
        >
          ❓ Help & FAQs
        </h2>

        <!-- Merged Safe + Free Question -->
        <div
          class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-lg p-4 md:p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/20 text-white"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-yellow-400">
            1. Is live streaming safe and free?
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-gray-300">
            Yes, the app is completely safe and you can access live match
            previews and streaming directly from our platform without any hidden
            charges. Avoid any other apps that try to mimic our name to ensure
            security.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-lg p-4 md:p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/20 text-white"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-yellow-400">
            2. When will live streaming be available?
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-gray-300">
            Live streaming will start automatically when the match begins. Make
            sure to click on the
            <span class="text-red-400 font-semibold">Watch Live Now</span>
            button on the homepage once the match is live.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-lg p-4 md:p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/20 text-white"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-yellow-400">
            3. How can I watch live matches?
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-gray-300">
            Simply click on the
            <span class="text-red-400 font-semibold">Watch Live Now</span>
            button on the homepage to start streaming IPL 2026 and T20 World Cup
            matches instantly.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-lg p-4 md:p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/20 text-white"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-yellow-400">
            6. Is News Channel available in live streaming?
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-gray-300">
            Yes, <span class="text-red-400 font-semibold">News Channel</span> is
            available as a
            <span class="text-yellow-400 font-semibold">24×7 live stream</span>
            on our platform. You can watch live news anytime and stay updated
            with the latest breaking news, politics, world headlines, and more
            in real time.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-lg p-4 md:p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/20 text-white"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-yellow-400">
            4. What tournaments are available?
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-gray-300">
            We provide coverage for
            <span class="text-yellow-400">IPL 2026</span>
            and <span class="text-blue-400">World Cup</span>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-lg p-4 md:p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/20 text-white"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-yellow-400">
            5. Who developed this platform?
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-gray-300">
            This platform has been expertly developed and maintained by
            <span class="text-yellow-400 font-semibold">Naveen Rathore</span>,
            ensuring a seamless and reliable user experience.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer
      class="bg-black/50 border-t border-white/20 text-center py-5 text-sm md:text-base"
    >
      <span class="text-white">© 2026</span>
      <span class="font-bold text-red-500">
        Cric<span class="text-white">Pulse</span>
      </span>
      <span class="text-white"> • Developed by Naveen Rathore</span>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
